<title>JAPAN: INSIGHT -JGBs seen hovering around 125.00.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT -JGBs seen hovering around 125.00.</headline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>FUTURE RANGE/DAY   SPPRT    RSTNC    RSI-9   MA-5     MA-25</p>
<p>JGB  124.70-125.20 124.60   125.40   64pct  124.86    124.04</p>
<p>OUTLOOK OF BOJ OPERATION AT 0020 GMT: injection of 100 bln yen</p>
<p>-------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 11------------------</p>
<p>*Key September 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) futures are likely to move around 125.00 on Friday amid a lack of direction.</p>
<p>*The contract may try upperside target of 125.04 after Thursday's rise stopped at 124.93. Firm support expected at around 124.62, Thursday's session low.</p>
